@page "/support"
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

@* Public: somebody locked out cannot sign in to ask for help. *@

<PageTitle>Support · Zazi</PageTitle>

<div class="legal">
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <p class="lead">
        Something wrong, or a question? Write to us and we will answer. Tell us what you were
        doing and we can usually see the rest ourselves.
    </p>

    <h2>Write to us</h2>
    <p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:support@getzazi.com">support@getzazi.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>What helps us fix it quickly</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Your business name.</li>
        <li>What you were doing when it happened, and what you expected instead.</li>
        <li>The time it happened, roughly.</li>
        <li>For a transaction: the customer's number, or the reference shown on the transaction.</li>
        <li>For the app: the version, shown at the bottom of the phone's dashboard.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted">
        Never send us your password. We will never ask for it, and we do not need it to help you.
    </p>

    <h2>Common things</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>An agent cannot sign in.</strong> Activation codes are used once and expire. Issue a fresh one on the Team page.</li>
        <li><strong>A transaction is missing.</strong> If the phone was offline it will send when there is signal. The agent's screen says what is still waiting.</li>
        <li><strong>A balance looks wrong.</strong> Open the agent from Cash &amp; float: every figure there is explained by the ledger below it.</li>
        <li><strong>An amount was recorded incorrectly.</strong> Nothing is deleted. Record a correction, which stays visible beside the original.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Reporting something serious</h2>
    <p>
        Suspected fraud, a security problem, or money that does not add up: write to
        <a href="mailto:support@getzazi.com">support@getzazi.com</a> with "urgent" in the subject.
    </p>

    <p><a href="/privacy">How we handle your data</a></p>
</div>
